          "text": "2.      ADMISSIBILITY ANALYSIS OF THE APPEAL                                                 I\nThe appeal was filed within the legal 10-day period following notification of the decision, making\nit timely. The appellant invoked the remedies provided by Articles 21 to 24 of Decree No. 724/2012,\nand there was no waiver of instance. The interested party is the legitimate appellant under Article\n63, paragraph 11, of Law No. 784/1999. Upon receipt of the appeal.",
